   214	  // DLPack consumer rule: when done, call the producer's deleter (it may be NULL). Called with the GIL held (every
   215	  // tc_signal entry point runs under the GIL), so a deleter that touches Python objects is safe.
   216	  if (legacy != nullptr) {
